13. As the radix of contentious debate is patently traceable to the various provisions of law, it would be apposite to refer and reproduce the following relevant provisions:-
A. RELEVANT SECTIONS OF THE FOOD SAFETY AND STANDARDS ACT 2006 3(1)(m) Food Authority means the Food Safety and Standards Authority of India established under section 4;
3(1)(t) Food Safety Officer means an officer appointed under Section 37 ;
